# Majors that cannot install beside their manifest, accepted with reasoning.
# scripts/check-held-majors.sh reads this; the format is
#
#   <directory> <package> <reason>
#
# An entry is a debt: the check fails once the bump installs or there is no
# newer major left, so nothing here outlives its reason.

# openapi-typescript 7 drives the TypeScript JavaScript compiler API and peers
# on typescript ^5.x; the Go-based TypeScript 7 does not ship that API. This
# manifest exists to hold that pair. Mirrors the typescript semver-major
# ignore in .github/dependabot.yml; both go when openapi-typescript widens
# the range.
tools/api-types typescript openapi-typescript 7 peers on typescript ^5.x
